{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b5171641b7ada19b9dc550423d976ac1155146247111b1dfff64e07aa2dc450a", "ja": "（機械都市が舞台の作品にまつりが出演する。\nロボットの長だが、一筋縄ではいかない役柄だ……）", "zh": "（茉莉将出演一部以机械都市为舞台的作品。\n她饰演的是机器人首领，但这个角色可没那么简单……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "5ac3d8e3f14a122ca290eeafefc27705156b85026ac15c078c8fe1453a65f076", "ja": "……来たか。\nタマキ、伝えなければならないことがある。", "zh": "……你来了吗。\n环，我有事必须告诉你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1002_p", "source_sha256": "249c05d6c8c975c1a7b3dbb13bbbcf53568d074874d3f0421b07822a7faa4fdf", "ja": "（正体を隠したマツリが、巡回中のタマキに接触する\n場面。終盤に入る前の大事な会話だ）", "zh": "（隐藏身份的茉莉与正在巡逻的环接触的场面。这是进入终盘前的一段重要对话）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "1e9f605e57d37d18d32f8ab2949a706c62aa16359b67a841bd59311519e8ce28", "ja": "決行するなら今しかない。\n君に……『君たち』に、その覚悟はあるか？", "zh": "要付诸行动就只有现在了。\n你……“你们”，做好这个觉悟了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1004_p", "source_sha256": "04853bdb5d20ee36e7095c12e7ab68a1ad5360d444666add4a2364da2e831c5b", "ja": "（話を聞いたタマキは憤慨し、\n相手がマツリとも知らず協力を依頼する……）", "zh": "（听完后，环怒不可遏，甚至不知道对方就是茉莉，便请求她协助……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "642e6d05d2c5c85d0295a6e0a305fb6ec82cf6dce249fd4da6addc8c7d0a47c1", "ja": "……もちろん。約束しよう。\n必ずロボットたちを屈服させる、と。", "zh": "……当然。我向你保证。\n定会让那些机器人臣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "fe9a4cd40b99def76dfd0acc943ace6fdb19d79a8c949477fc815b2d1134ddd1", "ja": "こちらの心配はいらない。\nでは……良き風が吹かんことを。", "zh": "不用担心我这边。那么……愿好风吹拂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "42f39b0c59b0365e9921eba4a420b9d7b9e4a07ce49d282698cad757c0d401e9", "ja": "……ふふっ、愚かで哀れ。\nじつに『人間』らしいです。", "zh": "……呵呵，愚蠢而又可悲。真是十足的『人类』呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1009_p", "source_sha256": "146908a8f0041d2672b8434127d483897b085ee17c3b6bb93532d8e38b3729ef", "ja": "お疲れさま、まつり。\n見てるこっちも緊張して、ドキドキしちゃったよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，茉莉。\n看得我也跟着紧张起来，心都怦怦直跳了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "3db6a08d3cc55fbe0bf5e91f1a83f7647e090760ee3a2c7523a6dc5b200893be", "ja": "ありがとうなのです♪\nでも姫は、ふつうに演じただけ、なのですよ？", "zh": "谢谢你♪  \n不过人家只是正常发挥而已哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "514457fd56f037ba4e4c09132bd3367cc66932bb439055a2d912843142cc5083", "ja": "環ちゃんのぱーふぇくと！な演技があったからこそ、\n素敵なシーンになったのです。", "zh": "正因为有环的完美演技，才成就了精彩的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ef7525ba81316331f449bfa9e3afaced39a9ea52bd1c003997fb42712accd675", "ja": "そうだな。でも、まつりの謎の人物としての怪しさが\nあったからこそ、あの空気感を出せたんだと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。不过，正因为茉莉作为神秘人物所散发出的可疑气息，我觉得才能营造出那种氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "54a582d7c405c0399e976690098f4f5f91a372749d06b5e8d96c16cac45bd74e", "ja": "わんだほー！　そこに気がつくとは、\nさすが、{$P$}さんなのです。", "zh": "太棒了！　能注意到这一点，\n真不愧是{$P$}先生呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "34b374fc44757e2751471da88e440d8497fb1b77fd995b4208232c5ae068ce31", "ja": "確かにあのシーンの姫は、あくまでも引き立て役……\nメインは、あとのお楽しみなのです♪", "zh": "那个场景里的公主，确实只是个配角……\n重头戏，留到后面再好好期待吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fe0e9d7fa92bca35d06af35c6bf7ecd446dd4554c815cac03d8ee2b92bf48e69", "ja": "マツリの出番は、最後に集中しているからな。\nこれは準備運動ってとこか。", "zh": "因为小祭的戏份都集中在最后嘛。\n这就算是热身吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "8cfb8009cc0bdc6e25cb30af2839c433cd7742a863a89c492b3f1537529294a7", "ja": "ほ？　{$P$}さん。準備といっても、\n姫はいつでも全力なのです。今のシーンもなのですよ！", "zh": "嗯？{$P$}先生。虽说是准备，公主无论何时都要全力以赴的哦。刚才的场景也是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bec41ebd9f07951b44fb7d6c911095f7551bee068a693c3f3877113ad266f07e", "ja": "おっと、そうだよな。\nさすが、いい覚悟だ！", "zh": "哦，对啊。\n不愧是你，有这样的觉悟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "7950e982969b256d2d1c57057163d80ee3d7abb6fa08df26cf16d0ea51cce9df", "ja": "でも、この後はいよいよクライマックスの撮影。\nつまり、マツリの晴れ舞台なのです！", "zh": "不过，接下来终于要拍摄高潮部分了。\n也就是说，这是小祭大放异彩的舞台哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0584_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "1c8d243ab1676b486588cd17ab00dd4cd45cb3f08cae407d1fe2430daa9b1adf", "ja": "王様として、頂点に立つ者として。\nアンビリーバボー！にみんなを驚かせるのです♪", "zh": "作为国王，作为站在顶点之人。\n要用难以置信的表现让大家大吃一惊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
